Open Vanilla 0031: the Duels queue only on a press, and an accept window before every match. Auto-queue is
gone (OpenVanilla.Duels.AutoQueue is read no more: you queue when you press a button). A match that forms
waits in CONFIRM: everyone gets "ready,<mode>,<match>,<seconds>" and answers "accept <match>" or
"decline <match>" ("ready,count,<match>,<yes>,<of>" as answers come in). All yes: "ready,go,<match>" and it
ports as before, into its own copy of the arena. A no, a logout or 30 s without an answer: whoever accepted
goes back into the queue where they were ("ready,back,<match>"), the rest are out ("ready,missed,<match>").

